      </widget>
     </item>
     <item>
      <widget class="KContextualHelpButton" name="disableRadiusHelp">
       <property name="contextualHelpText">
        <string>Removes the corner radius on maximized windows so the glow does not clip against the screen edges.

Note: the maximized state is inferred from the window's geometry so detection is not always accurate. A normal window that happens to match the maximized size will also be drawn with zero radius. This will be improved in a future release.</string>
       </property>
      </widget>
     </item>
